cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SynRAG in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "SyntaxRAG (SynRAG): AST-native local code search over MCP with a dependency impact graph"
abstract: "Local MCP server that chunks code by its syntax tree with Tree-sitter, retrieves candidates with BM25 over LanceDB, reranks them on CPU with FlashRank and resolves imports into a dependency impact graph, so coding agents read the exact definition instead of whole files. Measured with a real agent on 10 multi-step tasks x 2 rounds: -63.9 % billed tokens (95 % CI -83 % to -24 %), correct answers 87 % -> 94 %. Every figure has a reproducible script in benchmarks/ and a row in CLAIMS.md."
type: software
authors:
